/**
 * @defgroup core Core
 * @brief Application lifecycle, scene lifecycle, and the command-line, logging,
 * and window helpers Application depends on.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup scene Scene
 * @brief Scene graph and Entity-Component system: GameObject, the base
 * Component type, and the built-in component types.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup camera Camera
 * @brief Camera projection/view state and the view frustum used for
 * CPU-side visibility tests.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup rendering Rendering
 * @brief Renderer-facing public runtime: meshes, materials, textures,
 * skybox, and model loading.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup animation Animation
 * @brief Skeletal animation runtime: clips, blending state machines, and
 * the skeleton bone hierarchy.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup vertexformats Vertex Formats
 * @brief Custom vertex format registration API a game uses to describe its
 * own vertex layouts to the renderer.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup lighting Lighting
 * @brief Light types (directional, point, spot, area) and the manager that
 * collects them for rendering.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup physics Physics
 * @brief Collision shapes, broadphase structures, rigidbody simulation, and
 * the physics world that drives them.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup events Events
 * @brief Core event types plus the dispatcher and delegate machinery that
 * routes them.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup input Input
 * @brief Keyboard, mouse, and action-mapped input handling.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup culling Culling
 * @brief CPU frustum culling and software occlusion culling against a
 * rasterized depth buffer.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup math Math
 * @brief Vectors, matrices, quaternions, colors, and general math helpers.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup memory Memory
 * @brief Reference-counted and smart pointer types used for engine resource
 * ownership.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup utility Utility
 * @brief General-purpose containers, the String type, and the exception
 * hierarchy.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup debug Debug
 * @brief Debug line rendering, benchmarking, and runtime system metrics
 * overlays.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup ui UI
 * @brief Thin Dear ImGui wrapper; the only UI surface Game is allowed to
 * call.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup filesystem File System
 * @brief File access and the serialization interfaces built on top of it.
 */
